title = "Thunder Point Campaign (TVE)"

[Overview]
<background="nsstart">
<center><h2>Thunder Point Campaign (The Var'ca Episode)</h2>
<P>~B~iHistroy:~w<P>
The Var'ca is the title given to a single High Priest of the Sameron Faith.  This calling is the holiest 
amoung the Samerons.  It is written that the Var'ca is 
the mouthpiece of the furies to the people of Nimbus. It is said that once a Var'ca has died that the furies 
pick the next Var'ca themselves.  The way they accommplish this is by visiting worthy High Priest through dreams
and proving them with a series of 5 Trials.  He who passes all five trials 
assumes the responiblity and title of Var'ca.  
<P>~B~iPresent:~w<P>
During Martol's short quest for Nimbus domination, he had the Holy Var'ca killed and appointed 
himself to the title.  It is believed that the Furies were displeased with Martol and helped destroy him because he proclaimed himself Var'ca falsely, and the Furies will
not allow a false Var'ca to lead the people. Now, it is time for a new Var'ca to be choosen.
<P><a href="http://www.geocities.com/TimesSquare/Ring/8655/">Visit Thunder Point</a>
<P><a href="mailto:JR@upb.byu.edu">Email: jrc</a>

